		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_bc10r0401_man3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おかねで　なんでも
てにはいるとは　かぎらない▼
だが　たいていの　ものは
おかねで　てにはいるんだよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T07:47:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>お金で　なんでも
手に入るとは　限らない▼
だが　大抵の　ものは
お金で　手に入るんだよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T07:48:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T07:26:58" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MAN3</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T03:59:31" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_bc10r0401_middlewoman1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>みんなと　おなじなら
まんぞく！　って　ダメよ▼
そんなの　かんがえてないだけ！
わるい　おとなに　だまされちゃうよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-12T03:07:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>みんなと　同じなら
満足！　って　ダメよ▼
そんなの　考えてないだけ！
悪い　大人に　だまされちゃうよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-12T03:07:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T07:27:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLEWOMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T03:59:31" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_bc10r0401_middleman1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うーん　もっと　かねになる
いい　しごとは　ないか！？▼
だって　そうだろ？▼
おなじ　しごとを　するなら
たくさん　おかねを　もらいたいよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T07:49:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>うーん　もっと　金になる
いい　仕事は　ないか！？▼
だって　そうだろ？▼
同じ　仕事を　するなら
たくさん　お金を　もらいたいよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T07:50:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T07:26:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MIDDLEMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T03:59:31" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_bc10r0401_badman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　ポケモン
うったら　いくらに　なるのか？▼
ん？　ねだん　だって
こいつの　かちを　あらわしてるぜ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T07:53:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この　ポケモン
売ったら　いくらに　なるのか？▼
ん？　値段だって
こいつの　価値を　表してるぜ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T07:53:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T07:27:00" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BADMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T03:59:31" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
